  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional dimension and management of the Team Europe Initiative (TEI) on Manufacturing and Access to Vaccines, Medicines and Health Technologies (MAV+) in Africa. Part III.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention logic of this third regional Action (MAV+ III) focuses on three specific objectives:Enhanced financial inclusion of African operators along the pharmaceutical value chain, innovators and manufacturers of essential vaccines, medicines or health technologies that supply African markets and local health systems.Improved ecosystem for private sector&#xbf;s full engagement in the development and manufacturing of essential vaccines, medicines and health technologies in Africa. Enhanced access to health products and services through strengthened health systems and improved emergency preparedness and response to infectious diseases.</narrative>
  </description>
